            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Scriberman 1.1.2</h2>
<h3>What’s new</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Opt in to beta updates through the hidden Dev Features tab. Click the current version in Settings seven times to unlock it.</li>
  <li>Adjust audio sync and capture recovery settings in Dev Features. Changes apply to the next recording.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixes</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Recordings retain their original audio sync settings through completion and recovery, even if you change settings afterward.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
